# TRANSLATOR CONTEXT & GAME OVERVIEW:
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Game: The Journeyman Project 2: Buried in Time
# Protagonist: Agent 5 (Gage Blackwood), Temporal Security Agency (TSA)
# Plot: Frame-up mystery. Gage travels across time to gather evidence clearing
#       himself of altering history for perosnal gain.
# Key Characters:
#   - Gage Blackwood (Agent 5): Player character, TSA temporal agent.
#   - Arthur: Gage's AI  companion (witty, sarcastic, highly informative) whom he meets
#    during the evnets of the game and who serves as the game's hint system.
#   - Michelle Visard (Agent 3): Fellow agent and friend to the protagonist. Agent
#    3 is ultimately responsible for framing the main characcter to cover up her plot
#    to give time travel technology to alien races.
# Locations:
#
#  Buried in Time is a time travel game. As such, its setting spans multiple terestrial
#  and non-terestrial locations spanning the past and fuuture.
#
#   - Château Gaillard, France, (1204 AD)
#   - Leonardo da Vinci's Studio, Italy (1488 AD)
#   - Chichen Itza, Mexico (1050 AD)
#   - Farnstein's Laboratory (2247 AD) (A derelict mining and research space station)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
