msgid "Has that bird thing ever fooled anyone?"
msgstr ""

#. Location: Farnstein's Lab (2247 AD) or Gage's Apartment (2318 AD)
#. Track ID: FAKI_C02
#. Speaker: Arthur
msgid "Hey, it's the quicker picker-upper."
msgstr ""

#. Location: Farnstein's Lab (2247 AD) or Gage's Apartment (2318 AD)
#. Track ID: FAKI_I01
#. Speaker: Arthur
